# Public base URL of the backend API (no trailing slash).
#
# The portal reads shared names, photos, and media from this service. Without
# it, the portal still reads listings from Solana RPC, but off-chain documents
# fall back to the current browser's local copy only.
#
# Set this in Vercel under Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Vite bakes it into the bundle at build time, so redeploy after changing it.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
